5,1,1,talk,Minato,,I worry about the person who has to chase the money next year.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,We need to know the actual costs before we set any figure.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minako,,I want to keep the door open for new people to drift in.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,The evenings feel hesitant lately. I want to fix that.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I am curious why the same faces are always there.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@Ryuji, do you have a number in mind for the base cost?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Minato, not yet. I need to see where the money actually goes.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@May, I agree. If it feels like a burden, people will leave.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,"@Minako, exactly. It should feel like belonging, not a transaction.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Ryuji, I suspect the costs are skewed by who actually shows up.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Minato,,I will check the treasurer's logs to see the workload.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I will look at the ledger to see the fixed costs.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minako,,I will check the taster forms to see why people don't join.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,I will look at the turnout since the summer outings.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I will check the sign-in sheets to see the attendance split.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Minato,,"Also, I will check the bank statements for renewal delays.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,And I will check the mid-year joiner records for calculation hassle.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Minako,,And I will check the winter social feedback from quieter members.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,May,,And I will check the rota against the attendance record.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,And I will check the minute books from the named-grade years.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
