60,3,1,talk,Minato,,"Option A is the easiest to manage, but it feels unfair to light users.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,Option A is the only one that covers the fixed costs reliably.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
