64,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,Option C is the most honest about who is actually using the club.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Minato,,"@Ryuji, but the treasurer's hours were high even with a flat fee?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Minato, no, the hours were high because of the mid-year joiners.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
