75,3,4,talk,Minato,,"If we go with A, we need to set the fee carefully.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Ryuji,,"Yes, and we need to handle mid-year joiners better.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
