78,3,4,talk,May,,I think A is the safest bet for keeping the social vibe.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Shunichi,,"I think C is the most just, but I understand the hesitation.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
